<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Shrei</title><description>底层技术分析与实现过程，覆盖逆向工程、图形驱动栈、游戏引擎、操作系统内核与渲染管线设计</description><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/</link><language>zh-CN</language><item><title>确定性刷怪导演系统的结构设计</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-spawn-director-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/22-spawn-director-design/</guid><description>把刷怪拆成确定性随机、带占用修正的候选加权选择、性能账本与容量门禁的双账本、生命周期驱动的显式回收和带原因码的状态机，得到一个可复现、分布合理、数量有界的刷怪导演系统。</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>游戏系统设计</category><category>Spawn System</category><category>AI Director</category><category>Determinism</category><category>State Machine</category><category>Game Design</category></item><item><title>SiNiSistar 2 资源加密逆向：Rijndael-256-CBC 的完整解密链路</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/21-sinisistar2-ab-decryption/</guid><description>现在 Unity 独立游戏也是用上自定义 AB 加密了...</description><pubDate>Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>AssetBundle</category><category>Rijndael</category><category>Frida</category></item><item><title>高度场驱动的 WebGL 折射与接缝过渡</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/20-starlake-wallpaper-refraction-seam/</guid><description>壁纸在水面波动时产生折射扭曲，壁纸和正文之间有一段平滑过渡带而不是硬切。这两个效果都在一个 fragment shader 里完成，靠高度场纹理驱动位移，靠 CSS 变量控制色调。</description><pubDate>Sat, 20 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>前端渲染</category><category>WebGL</category><category>GLSL</category><category>Shader</category><category>Canvas</category></item><item><title>二维波动方程的数值模拟：Canvas 上的水面高度场</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/19-starlake-wavefield-fluid-sim/</guid><description>博客背景的水面波动是跑在 Canvas 上的二维波动方程数值解。从离散化公式、双缓冲、高斯扰动注入、视口剔除到风场驱动，拆开一个水面模拟系统的每一层。</description><pubDate>Fri, 19 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>前端渲染</category><category>Canvas</category><category>WebGL</category><category>Fluid Simulation</category><category>Wave Equation</category></item><item><title>UE 四件套反射调用链：GNames / GObjects / GWorld / ProcessEvent</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/18-ue-four-piece-reflection-chain/</guid><description>UE 逆向四件套 GNames、GObjects、GWorld、ProcessEvent 的反射调用链结构解析。</description><pubDate>Thu, 18 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Reflection</category><category>GNames</category><category>GObjects</category><category>GWorld</category><category>ProcessEvent</category></item><item><title>无设备对象内核驱动：控制面、会话生命周期与诊断边界</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/17-device-object-free-kernel-driver-control-plane/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/17-device-object-free-kernel-driver-control-plane/</guid><description>无设备对象不是少写一个设备对象，而是把设备对象原本提供的发现入口、会话句柄、命令边界、返回状态和生命周期语义，显式转移到项目自己的协议、状态机和资源清理模型里。</description><pubDate>Wed, 17 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 内核</category><category>Windows</category><category>Kernel Driver</category><category>WDM</category><category>Control Plane</category><category>Driver Design</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Internal Call：UnityAPI惰性加载与初始化路径分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/16-il2cpp-internal-call-resolution/</guid><description>IL2CPP 的部分 UnityEngine API 不在 GameAssembly 中直接实现，而是通过 internal call 按名字惰性加载到 UnityPlayer 的 native 函数。以 UnityEngine API 为例，拆开 generated wrapper 惰性缓存、InternalCalls::Resolve、UnityPlayer 注册表和 native 落点之间的完整链路。</description><pubDate>Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category><category>UnityPlayer</category></item><item><title>UE 三面映射材质：坐标投影、方向权重与材质层组织</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/15-ue-triplanar-material/</guid><description>三面映射不是一个单独的贴图技巧，而是一组围绕空间坐标、法线权重、纹理采样、法线重定向和材质层混合展开的材质结构。本文按笔记形式整理 UE 三面映射材质的节点职责和组合数学。</description><pubDate>Mon, 15 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 渲染</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Material</category><category>Triplanar</category><category>Shader</category><category>Rendering</category></item><item><title>Windows 内核异常分发：从 Trap Frame 到用户态处理链</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/14-windows-kernel-exception-dispatch/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/14-windows-kernel-exception-dispatch/</guid><description>用户态看到的 VEH/SEH（向量化/结构化异常处理）只是异常分发的下游。真正的入口在内核：CPU 异常进入内核保存 Trap Frame（陷阱帧），KiDispatchException 构造异常记录，经过调试器 first chance（第一次机会），再通过 KiUserExceptionDispatcher 进入用户态处理链。</description><pubDate>Sun, 14 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 内核</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Kernel</category><category>Exception Handling</category><category>Trap Frame</category></item><item><title>UE5 Chaos 场景碰撞绘制：运行时碰撞数据读取与线框渲染</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/09-ue5-chaos-collision-wireframe/</guid><description>从运行时进程读取 UE5 Chaos 碰撞数据，结合 UObject 反射和启发式扫描，将碰撞形状转成可渲染线框。</description><pubDate>Sat, 13 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>UE 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>UE5</category><category>Chaos</category><category>Collision</category></item><item><title>Windows 异常机制：异常上下文、分发顺序与可恢复执行</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/12-windows-exception-context-dispatch/</guid><description>Windows 异常不是简单的崩溃通知，而是一套带线程上下文的分发机制。理解异常记录、上下文、VEH、SEH 和调试器路径，是分析断点、单步、Guard Page、反调试和控制流追踪的基础。</description><pubDate>Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Exception Handling</category><category>VEH</category><category>SEH</category><category>Debugging</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Registration 与字段偏移的运行时恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/11-il2cpp-registration-runtime-recovery/</guid><description>global-metadata.dat 只能恢复静态类型语义。要拿到字段偏移、方法地址和类型布局，还需要在 GameAssembly.dll 中定位 CodeRegistration 与 MetadataRegistration。</description><pubDate>Thu, 11 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Registration</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP Metadata 的跨进程定位与类型系统恢复</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/10-il2cpp-metadata-recovery/</guid><description>外部工具处在 IL2CPP 内部 API 之外时，仍然可以利用 global-metadata.dat 的结构约束，在 GameAssembly.dll 的内存中定位 metadata，并恢复类型、字段、方法等静态语义。</description><pubDate>Wed, 10 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>Metadata</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Unity IL2CPP 启动原理：从 UnityPlayer 到 GameAssembly 的初始化序列</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/01-il2cpp-init-deep-dive/</guid><description>双击运行 Unity 游戏时，引擎内部经历了一系列初始化序列，才能把 C# 代码真正运转起来。本文基于 Unity 2022.3.62 IL2CPP 产物的逆向分析，从 UnityPlayer 动态加载 GameAssembly 讲到 MetadataCache、Registration 表、类型索引、方法查询和内存布局。</description><pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>IL2CPP 元数据表：从一张表还原 Unity 项目全貌</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/02-il2cpp-registration-counts/</guid><description>每个 IL2CPP 构建的 Unity 游戏，都在 GameAssembly.dll 里藏了一份记录 runtime 索引规模的表。本文教你读懂这份户口本，用真实数据量化项目复杂度。</description><pubDate>Mon, 08 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Unity 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Unity</category><category>IL2CPP</category><category>GameAssembly</category></item><item><title>Windows 控制流追踪：用硬件断点与 VEH 实现基本块级 trace</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/08-windows-dr-veh-control-flow-tracing/</guid><description>在 Windows x64 上用 DR0-DR3 硬件断点和 VEH 异常分发实现低开销基本块级控制流追踪。</description><pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>Windows 逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Windows</category><category>Debug Register</category><category>VEH</category><category>Control Flow</category></item><item><title>MCP 通信设计：Server-First 架构与命名管道实现</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-mcp-communication-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/13-mcp-communication-design/</guid><description>MCP 标准传输层 stdio 要求客户端 spawn 服务端，TCP 在本地场景引入端口冲突和网络栈开销。对 Unreal Editor 等本地重量级工具，命名管道是唯一同时满足 Server-First 和本地零开销的选项。本文从 TCP 在本地场景的两条结构性缺陷出发，论证命名管道的必要性，并给出帧协议、多实例路由和线程模型的完整实现。</description><pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>IPC</category><category>Named Pipe</category><category>Unreal Engine</category><category>Server-First</category></item><item><title>MCP 上下文优化：数据压缩与按需加载——字典索引文本格式</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/07-mcp-context-optimization/</guid><description>MCP 对话的上下文窗口有限，但工具返回的数据天然膨胀。优化不是少返回字段，而是重新设计数据表示和加载策略。</description><pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Context Optimization</category><category>Data Format</category></item><item><title>MCP 上下文返回优化：声明式编辑与状态分离——Diff-Token 机制</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-mcp-communication-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/06-mcp-communication-design/</guid><description>Agent 调用写操作后只接收必要状态证据。上下文返回优化让请求描述想要什么，响应只确认改了什么，完整状态留在服务端。</description><pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Context Optimization</category><category>Diff Token</category></item><item><title>Thin Facade MCP 工具设计：100 个 Operation 如何压缩成 6 个 Tool</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/05-mcp-tool-design/</guid><description>传统 MCP 的上下文压力来自两处：系统提示词中的工具定义 + 对话历史中的 tool result。Thin Facade 通过 6 个 facade 工具 + 内部 operation registry + response mode 控制，让 AI 决定加载什么、返回什么。</description><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>MCP 架构</category><category>MCP</category><category>AI Tools</category><category>Architecture</category><category>Context Optimization</category></item><item><title>Vulkan 游戏中 DXGI/D3D12 Swapchain 的来源分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/04-vulkan-dxgi-d3d12-swapchain/</guid><description>使用 Vulkan 渲染的游戏，在抓帧或调试工具中却可能出现 DXGI/D3D12 相关对象。本文通过静态逆向分析，定位这些对象的来源路径，并给出排查方法。</description><pubDate>Tue, 02 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item><item><title>从 Vulkan ICD 到 WDDM Miniport：NVIDIA Windows 图形驱动行为链静态分析</title><link>https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://zushinzackery2-ship-it.github.io/blog/posts/03-nvidia-graphics-driver-stack/</guid><description>本文基于 NVIDIA Windows 图形驱动样本，梳理 Vulkan、OpenGL、D3D、DXGI 与 WDDM 之间的模块职责、接口边界与证据强度。</description><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>图形逆向</category><category>Reverse Engineering</category><category>Graphics</category><category>Vulkan</category><category>DXGI</category><category>D3D12</category><category>NVIDIA</category></item></channel></rss>